WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:05.310
What would happen when five IRS 1040 tax forms
were placed into the Clockworks?

00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:08.410
On Rough, the paper was shredded into thin
strips.

00:00:08.410 --> 00:00:12.570
On Coarse, the form became a block of wood
coated in paper-making chemicals.

00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:16.180
On 1:1, it became a 4868 tax form.

00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:20.350
On Fine, every blank space on the paper was
covered in deranged scrawlings against the

00:00:20.350 --> 00:00:24.359
IRS and taxation in general in a multitude
of different languages.

00:00:24.359 --> 00:00:30.390
On Very Fine, it became IRS from MXL in Roman
Numerals, filled in for the year 35 by one

00:00:30.390 --> 00:00:36.090
“GAIVS IVLIVS CAESAR AVGVSTVS GERMANICVS”,
with all sums recorded and paid in Ancient

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:37.100
Roman Denarii.

